          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu hiyo, mimi ninampa Mwenyezi-Mungu mtoto huyu; wakati wote atakapokuwa hai, ametolewa kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu.” Halafu, wakamwabudu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
